License copy: MTranServer-LICENSE

Modifications: Python/OpenVINO implementation; static padded source shapes and
attention masks; encoder and one-token SSRU decoder graphs; external recurrence;
FP16 weight storage; NPU-only execution without an execution-provider fallback.
MTranServer's automatic CPU selection, quantized ONNX runtime and service are not
included in this adapter.

The downloaded en-to-zh-Hans and ja-to-en weights and SentencePiece vocabularies come from
Mozilla Firefox Translations, separately under MPL-2.0. Their exact URLs and
checksums are recorded alongside the downloaded models in source.json.
The weight checksum matches models/base-memory/enzh/metadata.json at Mozilla
repository revision e7957fc407441a5e3e35bbcbf9d60d9b35764618.
License copy: Mozilla-Translations-LICENSE

The Japanese stage uses models/base/jaen/metadata.json at the same Mozilla
revision e7957fc407441a5e3e35bbcbf9d60d9b35764618 (version 3.0). The shared
Japanese/English vocabulary and both graph stages run through the same static
NPU adapter. Japanese-to-Chinese uses English as a pivot, not a direct model.
